      "message": "Hi Greg Kh, \n\nRead Only Array didn\u0027t working irq_stack_ptr use case. I observed compile time errors with that approach. \n\nDo you see any issues with this approach? Would it cause any functional issues ? \n\n1) We are trying to avoid kallsyms_lookup_name export as per Google guidelines but I am not 100% sure how Google would monitor the ABI for these symbols. \n2) Let me know if current design approach has any limitations. I can work with you to fix those issues. \n\n-Thanks, Prasad",
